{"final":{"answer":"$46.4 million increase","value":46.4,"unit":"$ in millions","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t4c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1","explanation":"Net change in Entergy Mississippi's net revenue for 2003 compared to 2002 = 2003 net revenue ($426.6 million) − 2002 net revenue ($380.2 million) = $46.4 million increase. The analysis table corroborates this: base rates +48.3 million and other −1.9 million = +46.4 million."}}